{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370312-implications-of-jiara","id":1370312,"title":"Implications of Jiara","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-25T04:59:33-08:00","id":1370312,"title":"Implications of Jiara","content":"I'm hoping this isn't a topic that's already been exhausted.<br /> <br /> Jiara seems to change the Scavenger Lands pretty significantly. Thorns was hugely important because it was the Realm's major foothold there, making its fall all the more calamitous. People used to sail all the way out to Greyfalls and back to get around trade sanctions against the Realm. I know Jiara's not as conveniently placed as Thorns, but it's pretty nearby. How does this change the politics of the River Province?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T05:55:24-08:00","id":1370328,"title":"","content":"As far as I know this topic hasn\u2019t even been brought up.<br /> <br /> <br /> I don\u2019t know if it changes the politics by much, although Jiara is certainly still important. It\u2019s about 700 miles south-west of Thorns, which puts it relatively close to the river provinces, but Thorns was already near the south-west border anyway, so it might not be close enough to have that same impact. There may also be another satrapy between Jiara and Thorns that takes the spot of greater importance due to proximity.<br /> <br /> Jiara might be more likely to be another gateway to Prasad, although the path you\u2019d take forces you awfully close to the Nameless Lair.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T06:08:23-08:00","id":1370332,"title":"","content":"I think the position is key; Jiara is right, right, right (or left) at the edge of the Scavenger Lands. It's closer to Harborhead (a Realm satrapy) than to most of the Scavenger Lands. As it's on the coast, it's easy for the Realm to reach.<br /> <br /> In addition, in order to get to the Scavenger Lands, you have to either go through a giant jungle, or through Thorns. So Thorns being lost to the Mask of Winters still means the Realm has no easy foothold into the Scavenger Lands, because an invasion through Jiara would have to go through Thorns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T06:10:33-08:00","id":1370334,"title":"","content":"Thorns sits right by the river allowing you to literally sail up to Nexus. Not so much Jiara. Plus there are a bunch of Satrapies in that general area... Varsi, Habourhead to the South... At least one other Satrap that came up in my Ask a Question about whether Habourhead and Jiara were adjacent.<br /> <br /> Plus Jiara has its own Anathema problem. And House Mnemon is there in force which may be a problem if, for example, you are a V'neef trader wanting a friendly port.<br /> <br /> Add in the threat of bandits. Wandering undead. Force projection from Thorns. I think it's still a major issue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 02-25-2020, 09:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T06:26:59-08:00","id":1370337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1370312-implications-of-jiara?p=1370334#post1370334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Varsi</div> </div> </div> </div> What's that?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> At least one other Satrap that came up in my Ask a Question about whether Habourhead and Jiara were adjacent. </div> </div> </div>Do you remember what it was?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T14:48:00-08:00","id":1370449,"title":"","content":"Yeah, ok, fair enough. Maybe I misread its significance a bit. Thanks m8s.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-25T15:43:21-08:00","id":1370461,"title":"","content":"I like the idea of Varsi allowing for a backdoor into the scavenger lands - like, a few new grand public works to carve roads east through the jungles, to the Grey river. Perhaps dig a canal? Sure it'd take a while, but perhaps an enterprising realm sorcerer could summon an army of demons for magical labor speed things up, or quest to entreaty local earth and wood elementals to rearrange the land?<br /> <br /> It could make for some fun things to do for players - or perhaps fun things for players to discover is happening around them, and then for them to figure out if it should be stopped or helped","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}